  "details": "Full Build: 2026.1.2-1799-a7b93606d4-Release\n\nA few days ago, I had to reset my computer for unrelated reasons. Upon re-installing VRChat, the large avatar selection menu no longer loads. I have no categories, no search, nothing. It's just the menu background.\n\nThis also causes issues if I go to view avatar stats and back out of the menu, which would be the avatar menu. Completely blank.\n\nI have cleared all caches, re-installed the game twice, and can confirm it does NOT happen on the public release, just the latest Open Betas.\n\nI can still access all avatars saved through third party apps and the \"wing\" menus, however this is a workaround and is very slow and clunky to use.",
